OL,5,G0400 Stories From The National Portrait
OL,6,G     Gallery
OL,7,     FKate Bryan explores 20th-century
OL,8,     Fportraiture, examining depictions
OL,9,     Fof war poets and Queen Elizabeth
OL,10,     FII. Jim Moir drops in to discuss
OL,11,     Fhis favourite work. (S1, ep 3)
OL,12,G0500 The Sixties
OL,13,     FThe War in Vietnam: A look at the
OL,14,     Fcomplexities that led to America's
OL,15,     Finvolvement in the Vietnam War and
OL,16,     Fhow it changed America in ways
OL,17,     Fthat reverberate even today. (S1,
